flowchart TB
  Source[.rosettai resources] --> IR[Validated canonical IR]
  IR --> Cap[Capability negotiation]
  Cap --> Strict{Strict mode?}
  Strict -->|Unsupported| Fail[Fail with actionable report]
  Strict -->|Supported| Compile[Adapter compilation]
  Cap -->|Compatible mode| Warn[Emit warnings and transformations]
  Warn --> Compile
  Compile --> Owned[Owned generated cache files]
  Owned --> Verify[Hash and provenance verification]
  Verify --> Run[Harness process]

  Secret[Environment or secret provider] --> Resolve[Resolve secret references]
  Resolve --> Compile
